  abilityDesc: 21 combo massive Water attack on all foes, enormously boosts Fire,
    Water elemental damage for 3 turns, enormous damage reduction from Fire, Earth
    types for 3 turns, adds probable 1 turn enormous Atk, Def reduction to attack
    for 3 turns & enormously boosts damage reduction when guarding for 3 turns
